 },
 "minutes": 40,
 "blocks": [
  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "How big is a complex number?",
    "kn": "ಸಂಕೀರ್ಣ ಸಂಖ್ಯೆ ಎಷ್ಟು ದೊಡ್ಡದು?"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "You cannot say 3 + 4i is bigger than 5i. But you can measure how far each is from zero, and both are exactly 5 away.",
    "kn": "3 + 4i ಯು 5i ಗಿಂತ ದೊಡ್ಡದು ಎನ್ನಲಾಗದು. ಆದರೆ ಶೂನ್ಯದಿಂದ ದೂರ ಅಳೆಯಬಹುದು; ಎರಡೂ ನಿಖರವಾಗಿ 5 ದೂರದಲ್ಲಿವೆ."
   },
   "objectives": [
    {
     "en": "Find the modulus and conjugate"
    },
    {
     "en": "Use their properties"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "You cannot say 3 + 4i is bigger than 5i. But you can measure how far each is from zero, and both are exactly 5 away.",
    "kn": "3 + 4i ಯು 5i ಗಿಂತ ದೊಡ್ಡದು ಎನ್ನಲಾಗದು. ಆದರೆ ಶೂನ್ಯದಿಂದ ದೂರ ಅಳೆಯಬಹುದು; ಎರಡೂ ನಿಖರವಾಗಿ 5 ದೂರದಲ್ಲಿವೆ."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Modulus and conjugate"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "For $z = a + ib$: modulus $|z| = \\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}$ and conjugate $\\bar{z} = a - ib$. Then $z\\bar{z} = |z|^2$, $|z_1 z_2| = |z_1||z_2|$, $|z_1/z_2| = |z_1|/|z_2|$, $\\overline{z_1 \\pm z_2} = \\bar{z}_1 \\pm \\bar{z}_2$, $\\overline{z_1 z_2} = \\bar{z}_1\\bar{z}_2$. Complex numbers cannot be ordered, so $>$ and $<$ do not apply to them.",
    "kn": "ಮಾಪಾಂಕ |z| = √(a² + b²), ಸಂಯುಗ್ಮ z̄ = a − ib. z ಮತ್ತು z̄ ಗುಣಲಬ್ಧ |z|². ಸಂಕೀರ್ಣ ಸಂಖ್ಯೆಗಳನ್ನು ದೊಡ್ಡದು–ಚಿಕ್ಕದು ಎಂದು ಹೋಲಿಸಲಾಗದು."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "|z| = |z̄| = |−z|"
    },
    {
     "en": "z + z̄ = 2 Re(z), z − z̄ = 2i Im(z)"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "The modulus is the square root of a squared plus b squared. The conjugate changes the sign of the imaginary part. A number times its conjugate is the modulus squared.",
    "kn": "ಮಾಪಾಂಕ |z| = √(a² + b²), ಸಂಯುಗ್ಮ z̄ = a − ib. z ಮತ್ತು z̄ ಗುಣಲಬ್ಧ |z|². ಸಂಕೀರ್ಣ ಸಂಖ್ಯೆಗಳನ್ನು ದೊಡ್ಡದು–ಚಿಕ್ಕದು ಎಂದು ಹೋಲಿಸಲಾಗದು."
   },
   "formula": "z\\,\\bar{z} = |z|^2, \\qquad z^{-1} = \\frac{\\bar{z}}{|z|^2}"
  },
